e and eventually materialize definite timed_out or failed terminal truth rather than wait forever.\",\"id\":\"CHK-001:edge:1\",\"priority\":\"must\",\"type\":\"cli\"}],\"happy\":[{\"desc\":\"Submit one managed provider run, observe immutable spec and owner plus a successful worker claim, then observe monotonic snapshots and events ending in exactly one completed terminal receipt whose digest is returned by status; proves the durable lifecycle from submission to terminal truth.\",\"id\":\"CHK-001:happy:0\",\"priority\":\"must\",\"type\":\"cli\"},{\"desc\":\"Terminate the original caller after submission while the provider remains active, then query the returned runId from a new caller and observe the same execution continue to completed without a second provider spawn or replacement; proves caller lifetime is not run lifetime.\",\"id\":\"CHK-001:happy:1\",\"priority\":\"must\",\"type\":\"cli\"}]}},{\"context\":\"Make foreground host_run submit-and-attach over the durable run, add detach submission with claim handshake, bounded host_run_status long-poll, idempotent host_run_cancel, and a hidden worker continuation. Keep text/json passthrough contracts and prompt secrecy.\",\"files\":{\"create\":[],\"modify\":[\"packages/main/src/cli-engine.ts\",\"packages/main/src/cli/command-catalog.ts\",\"packages/main/src/core/command-policy.ts\",\"packages/main/src/core/process-fact-levels.ts\",\"packages/main/src/handlers/host-run.ts\",\"packages/main/src/registry.ts\"],\"test\":[\"packages/main/src/tasks/managed-host-run-command-smoke.ts\"]},\"id\":\"CHK-002\",\"relatedDocs\":[\"docs/host-run-usage.md\",\"docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-codex-command-boundary-execution-plan.md\"],\"status\":\"done\",\"title\":\"Expose submit, attach, status and cancel command surfaces\",\"userSees\":\"After host_run --detach returns a runId, the user can host_run_status --waitMs for at most 30 seconds and host_run_cancel idempotently; foreground mode still streams live output, but the same r